WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.280
A new agent can get started faster when the
project tells it how to run the checks.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.968
Slash agents starts a setup
task in the active session.

3
00:00:10.968 --> 00:00:13.563
The agent reads the manifest and README,

4
00:00:13.563 --> 00:00:18.040
then writes the test command and
entry points into the project guide.

5
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.756
Review the instructions with
the repository in view.

6
00:00:30.756 --> 00:00:34.640
They should match how this project
is actually built and tested.
